flowchart RL
    domain[Domain\nEntities and invariants]
    application[Application\nUse cases and abstractions]
    infrastructure[Infrastructure\nEF Core, PostgreSQL, providers]
    hosts[API and ClientCli\nOuter delivery hosts]

    application -->|allowed reference| domain
    infrastructure -->|allowed reference| application
    infrastructure -->|allowed reference| domain
